<section id="what-is-crate" class="section" aria-labelledby="what-is-crate-title">
  <div class="body" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow"><b>What is</b> Crate</p>
    <h2 id="what-is-crate-title" class="display">Crate is not a streaming service.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Crate is a self-hosted music platform: your own library, enriched, analysed and streamed to
      the web, your phone and your desktop. Crate for Ryoku brings its look to the whole desktop and
      puts it on the QS Bar.
    </p>
    <p class="note">
      The Crate desktop app needs a Crate server; it does not play local files. For music on this
      computer, Ryoku's own player is Ryotunes.
    </p>
    <a class="primary" href="https://cratemusic.app">Discover Crate at cratemusic.app</a>
  </div>
</section>

